      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Teton Valley's Premier Giving Event</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Tin Cup Challenge is Teton Valley's premier community giving event — a six-week campaign that coordinates donations to local nonprofits, culminating in <a href="/news-events/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">Tin Cup Event Day</a>. Challengers match donations to amplify every gift.</p>
      <p class="content-split__text">Since its inception, the Tin Cup Challenge has channeled millions of dollars to Teton Valley nonprofits, making it one of the most impactful community giving events in the region.</p>
