      <h2 class="content-split__heading">How the Tin Cup Challenge Works</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Tin Cup Challenge runs as a six-week community giving campaign. Donors contribute to participating nonprofits, and Challengers provide matching funds that amplify the impact of every donation.</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Six-week community giving campaign</li>
        <li>Donations matched by Challengers</li>
        <li>Participating nonprofits receive amplified funding</li>
        <li>Culminates in <a href="/news-events/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">Tin Cup Event Day</a> celebration</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

